* Hierarchy and references: reuse one selection goal for several controls.
Goal: Purchase an item online
. Goal: Select control <search field>
.. Look at <search field>
.. Point to <search field>
.. Click <search field>
. Goal: Find item
.. @Goal Select control <search field>
.. Hands to keyboard
.. Type <item name>
.. Keystroke Enter
.. Search for <item name>
.. @Goal Select control <item name>
. Goal: Add item to cart
.. @Goal Select control <add to cart button>
.. Verify item is in cart
. Goal: Complete purchase
.. @Goal Select control <checkout button>
.. Verify order is submitted
